# 🔒 TOWN SQUARE — FACILITY LEADER REQUIREMENT SYSTEM

> **No Leader, No Operation.**
>
> Setiap fasilitas di Town Square membutuhkan seorang **Leader** yang ditunjuk oleh Master sebelum sistem otomatis fasilitas tersebut dapat berjalan.

---

# 1. CORE RULE

Setiap Facility memiliki:

```text
Leader Slot
```

Leader Slot harus terisi sebelum fasilitas dapat menjalankan fungsi utamanya.

```text
FACILITY
   │
   ▼
CHECK LEADER
   │
   ├── NO LEADER
   │      ↓
   │   FACILITY LOCKED
   │      ↓
   │   AI STOPPED
   │      ↓
   │   NO AUTOMATIC ACTIVITY
   │
   └── LEADER EXISTS
          ↓
       FACILITY ACTIVE
          ↓
        AI ACTIVE
```

---

# 2. FACILITY STATE

Setiap Facility memiliki status operasi.

```text
LOCKED
NO_LEADER
ACTIVE
PAUSED
DISABLED
UPGRADING
```

Status utama:

### NO_LEADER

Facility belum memiliki Leader.

```text
Leader:
NONE

Status:
NO_LEADER

Automation:
DISABLED
```

### ACTIVE

Facility memiliki Leader yang valid.

```text
Leader:
HERO-XXXXXX

Status:
ACTIVE

Automation:
ENABLED
```

---

# 3. NO LEADER = NO AUTOMATION

Jika Facility belum memiliki Leader:

```text
Crafting
Production
Worker Management
Automatic Recruitment
Automatic Processing
Facility Events
Facility AI
```

tidak dapat berjalan secara normal.

Contoh:

```text
BLACKSMITH
│
├── Leader: NONE
│
├── Workers: 0/4
│
├── Crafting: LOCKED
│
└── Automation: OFF
```

---

# 4. FACILITY INITIAL STATE

Ketika Facility pertama kali dibuat:

```text
Facility Created
       ↓
Leader = NULL
       ↓
Status = NO_LEADER
       ↓
Automation = FALSE
```

Contoh:

```text
FACILITY-000001

Name:
Blacksmith

Level:
1

Leader:
NULL

Status:
NO_LEADER

Automation:
FALSE
```

---

# 5. MASTER MUST ASSIGN LEADER

Only the Master can initially assign the Facility Leader.

```text
MASTER
   ↓
SELECT FACILITY
   ↓
ASSIGN LEADER
   ↓
SELECT HERO
   ↓
SYSTEM VALIDATION
   ↓
LEADER ASSIGNED
```

Setelah berhasil:

```text
Leader:
HERO-000125

Status:
ACTIVE

Automation:
TRUE
```

---

# 6. LEADER VALIDATION

Sebelum Hero menjadi Leader, sistem harus melakukan validasi.

```text
SELECT HERO
      ↓
CHECK HERO EXISTENCE
      ↓
CHECK HERO AVAILABILITY
      ↓
CHECK CURRENT ASSIGNMENT
      ↓
CHECK RESTRICTION
      ↓
CHECK FACILITY COMPATIBILITY
      ↓
APPROVE
```

Contoh:

Hero yang sedang menjalankan misi:

```text
HERO-000125
Status:
ACTIVE MISSION
```

Tidak dapat langsung menjadi Facility Leader.

---

# 7. LEADER CANNOT BE DOUBLE ASSIGNED

Satu Hero tidak boleh menjadi Leader pada beberapa fasilitas pada waktu yang sama kecuali sistem khusus di masa depan mengizinkannya.

Contoh:

```text
BLACKSMITH
Leader:
HERO-000125
```

Maka:

```text
ALCHEMY LAB
Leader:
HERO-000125
```

ditolak.

Reason:

```text
HERO_ALREADY_ASSIGNED
```

---

# 8. LEADER REMOVAL

Jika Master mencopot Leader:

```text
MASTER
   ↓
REMOVE LEADER
   ↓
LEADER = NULL
   ↓
FACILITY STATUS = NO_LEADER
   ↓
AUTOMATION = FALSE
```

Contoh:

```text
BLACKSMITH

Before:
Leader = HERO-000125
Status = ACTIVE

After:
Leader = NULL
Status = NO_LEADER
```

---

# 9. AUTOMATIC SYSTEM SHUTDOWN

Ketika Leader dicopot, sistem otomatis harus berhenti.

```text
LEADER REMOVED
      ↓
FACILITY AI STOP
      ↓
NEW TASK CREATION STOP
      ↓
AUTOMATIC WORKER ASSIGNMENT STOP
      ↓
AUTOMATIC CRAFTING STOP
```

Namun, sistem harus menentukan bagaimana menangani task yang sedang berjalan.

---

# 10. ACTIVE TASK

Jika sebuah aktivitas sedang berjalan ketika Leader dicopot:

```text
FACILITY
    ↓
ACTIVE TASK
    ↓
LEADER REMOVED
    ↓
TASK STATUS
```

Task dapat memiliki:

```text
PAUSED
CANCELLED
COMPLETED
```

Default:

```text
ACTIVE TASK
      ↓
LEADER REMOVED
      ↓
TASK = PAUSED
```

Task tidak langsung hilang.

