# 12. WORKER BEHAVIOR

Worker juga bergantung pada Facility Leader.

Jika:

```text
Leader = NONE
```

maka Worker tidak dapat menerima pekerjaan baru dari Facility AI.

```text
FACILITY
   │
   ├── Leader = NONE
   │
   └── Workers
         ↓
    WAIT / IDLE
```

Worker tidak otomatis melakukan aktivitas Facility.

---

# 13. WORKER ASSIGNMENT

Worker hanya dapat dikelola setelah Leader aktif.

```text
NO LEADER
    ↓
Worker Management
    ↓
LOCKED
```

Setelah Leader aktif:

```text
LEADER
   ↓
AI
   ↓
AVAILABLE HERO POOL
   ↓
SELECT WORKERS
```

---

# 14. FACILITY AI ACTIVATION

Facility AI hanya aktif jika:

```text
Leader != NULL
AND
Leader is Valid
AND
Facility State != DISABLED
```

Formula sederhana:

```text
FacilityAI =
    LeaderValid
    AND
    FacilityEnabled
```

Jika:

```text
LeaderValid = FALSE
```

maka:

```text
FacilityAI = OFF
```

