# 19. LEADER DEATH / UNAVAILABLE

Jika Leader menjadi tidak tersedia:

```text
Leader
   ↓
Dead / Missing / Mission Restricted / Event Restricted
```

Game State System melakukan validasi.

Jika Leader tidak lagi valid:

```text
LeaderValid = FALSE
       ↓
Facility = NO_LEADER
       ↓
Automation = OFF
```

Master kemudian harus menunjuk Leader baru.

---

# 20. LEADER ON MISSION

Jika Leader masuk Party dan pergi ke Dungeon:

```text
FACILITY LEADER
       ↓
JOIN PARTY
       ↓
ENTER DUNGEON
       ↓
LEADER UNAVAILABLE
       ↓
FACILITY AUTOMATION
       ↓
PAUSED
```

Default rule:

> **A Facility Leader cannot simultaneously manage a Facility and participate in an active Dungeon mission.**

