# 36. FACILITY AUTOMATION CONDITIONS

Automatic Facility System hanya dapat berjalan jika seluruh kondisi terpenuhi:

```text
Facility Unlocked
        AND
Leader Assigned
        AND
Leader Valid
        AND
Facility Enabled
        AND
Required Resources Available
```

Jika salah satu kondisi gagal:

```text
AUTOMATION PAUSED
```

