# 37. FINAL RULE

### FACILITY RULE

```text
IF
Leader == NULL

THEN
Facility Status = NO_LEADER
Facility AI = OFF
Automatic Crafting = OFF
Automatic Production = OFF
Worker Management = OFF
Automatic Facility Events = OFF
```

Jika:

```text
Leader != NULL
AND
Leader Valid
```

maka:

```text
Facility Status = ACTIVE
Facility AI = ON
Automatic Systems = ENABLED
```

