# 39. DESIGN PHILOSOPHY

> **A Facility is only a building until someone takes responsibility for it.**

The Master does not simply unlock a building and immediately receive automatic benefits.

The Master must first choose a Hero to take responsibility.

That Hero becomes the **Leader**.

The Leader activates the Facility.

The Facility AI then manages routine activities.

Workers assist the Leader.

RNG determines uncertain outcomes.

Game State System monitors everything.

Database System stores the persistent state.

AI Fairy reports important changes to the Master.

Therefore:

```text
UNLOCK FACILITY
      ↓
ASSIGN LEADER
      ↓
ACTIVATE FACILITY
      ↓
AI MANAGEMENT
      ↓
WORKERS
      ↓
CRAFT / PRODUCTION
      ↓
RNG
      ↓
GAME STATE
      ↓
DATABASE
```

### Core Principle:

# **NO LEADER → NO AUTOMATION → NO FACILITY OPERATION**
